    "name": "Petstore API (Swagger v2) - 31 Tests",
    "description": "Koleksi API testing Petstore lengkap 31 request (18 positive + 13 negative/edge).\nSetara dengan project RestAssured.\nBase URL default: https://petstore.swagger.io/v2\nSetiap request punya pm.test() di tab Tests.\n\nUrutan jalan: pakai Collection Runner biar variabel {{petId}}, {{orderId}}, {{username}} ke-set berurutan.",
